d": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 85, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 11:37", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877682537,47288722,430]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-07 11:34):[/b]<br/><br/>[s:ac:哭笑]道理我都懂&amp;#160; 为什么这几波PCB每次都这么主动这么强&amp;#160; &amp;#160;能不能讲讲[/quote]<br/>因为大光被制裁的前提下  还没轮到被制裁的海外链方向把诱多出货的进度加快了  <br/>本来可以慢慢来诱多 他们可以吃多点货再套多点人  这样完成自救<br/>但是现在大光带了头  这样自救进程要加快  哪怕出少一点也要尽快把散户吸引进去。", "lou": 191, "content_length": 203, "reply_to": 877682537, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786073849}, {"pid": 877683272, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 82, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 11:40", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877683088,47288722,431]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66233493]momo28484729[/uid] (2026-08-07 11:38):[/b]<br/><br/>看狼大的说法，怎么感觉半导体行情已经结束了...[/quote]<br/>并没有<br/>我还会回去的。但是肯定不是今天和周1", "lou": 192, "content_length": 46, "reply_to": 877683088, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786074015}, {"pid": 877684841, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 72, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 11:51", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们还在纠结的时候 我刚才一波切换  来回等于吃了4-5个点[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 193, "content_length": 49, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786074700}, {"pid": 877685202, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 58, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 11:54", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877685075,47288722,434]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66989363]鱼饵啊啊[/uid] (2026-08-07 11:53):[/b]<br/><br/>半仓套在PCB里等回本，你跟我说诱多，我的心死了。[s:ac:擦汗][/quote]<br/>你不用管我的  我说的不一定对。", "lou": 194, "content_length": 33, "reply_to": 877685075, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786074857}, {"pid": 877699462, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 71, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:10", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "呵呵 你们还在高位方向挣扎那一两个点的时间里<br/>你看低位的理你们么。哪个不是偷偷起来了。", "lou": 195, "content_length": 82, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786083046}, {"pid": 877699763, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 139, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877699621,47288722,459]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67276088]鸡你太太美[/uid] (2026-08-07 14:11):[/b]<br/><br/>呜呜呜呜，狼大！我选错低位了，进科大讯飞他好区！！！！[/quote]<br/>这个票建议你删除<br/>为什么大数据ETF我说他是垃圾  就是因为有这个票  还TM重仓。", "lou": 196, "content_length": 74, "reply_to": 877699621, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786083188}, {"pid": 877700218, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 99, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:17", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "怎么还没人来跟我科普光模块这两年订单不受影响 只是可能影响远期订单了？<br/>不习惯啊", "lou": 197, "content_length": 76, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786083440}, {"pid": 877700748, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 46, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:21", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877700479,47288722,462]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=10055213]ilovehoneyxue[/uid] (2026-08-07 14:19):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大我想问一嘴。如果后面鸡狗对中际重新评估估值，那会不会影响后面科技的长度？毕竟市场还是以大哥为矛(也许吧)[s:pg:哭][/quote]<br/>在重新估值之前  他们会选择 不做  不参与 特别是周5  谁不怕周末两天川普升级？<br/>除了被机构安抚的散户以外  谁不怕？", "lou": 198, "content_length": 104, "reply_to": 877700479, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786083699}, {"pid": 877701124, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 87, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 14:24", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877700754,47288722,462]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=8618693]尼克跑不快[/uid] (2026-08-07 14:21):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大提前一个月说了不做罕见链<br/>后面SAI减仓大哥二哥之后<br/>我是坚定一点都没打算碰了，<br/><br/>大佬不做的，可能会赚钱，但一定是不确定性非常高的，难度也很高的。<br/><br/>不去碰是对额。[/quote]<br/>我很少说 我不去做什么<br/>但是只要我说了  和我作对的没几个能活得好的。", "lou": 199, "content_length": 67, "reply_to": 877700754, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1786083895}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 24948, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1787283392, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "はんしゅいみん", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1787283392, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1787282907, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/size]", "alterinfo": "", "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}, "recommend": 0, "type": 33792, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "subject": false, "pid": null, "tid": 47206901, "fid": 510567}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 354, "fid": 510567, "14": {"14": 4, "13": 9, "17": 3, "12": 2, "11": 2, "10": 2, "15": 1}, "16": "63818397,64626166,67237704,12432602,67246750,27036967", "17": ",878690206,878734594,877971519,878928366"}, "this_visit_rows": 432}, "__F": {"name": "杂谈"}, "__R__ROWS": 20, "__R__ROWS_PAGE": 20, "__ROWS": 432, "__PAGE": 10}, "time": 1787283400}